      "postID": "62e4713fb7b64144b58f2bcb",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 9
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Content creator specific suggestions:\n• Camera Animation mod should be implemented too. Us content creators need it to move camera in 3D space smoothly.\n• Local Light Mod - sometimes world is too dark or we want specific lighting depending on the purpose of the video. Would be better if we can animate the movement of the Lighting too!\n• Change smoothness of the camera. The default smoothing option isn't enough in some scenarios, so having a customizable smooth value would be great to get the perfect motion smoothing.\n• Focal Length Indicator - this would be great to match in-game camera with real world cameras so we can create mixed reality content easily and more accurately.\n• Deeper zoom - The default max zoom isn't enough for me. I sometimes like to zoom in to my friends who are really far away from my location and get a clear picture of them.\n• Fisheye mode - for a more creative look. This extremely wide angle fisheye look could help to create a hyper realistic look depending on the purpose of the shots. Also it's fun to play with!\n• Aspect ratio changer - sometimes I want to film videos in 4:3 or ultra wide ratio so it would be great if the camera changes its shape according to the aspect ratio chosen.\n• Grid - helps in composition.\nAnd much more that I can't think of, but I hope VRChat team understands that content creators need these to create creative content",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
