  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-07-29T23:46:07.128Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hi! There are a selection of many requests that I've seen on discord, canny, and from me and my friends.\n\n> The most important things, that we need as soon as possible:\n• Instance History (and a icon on the worlds instances to know what instances you visited recently)\n• Avatar History (some times we change our avatars and forget to save the previous one)\n• Avatar Search (for public avatars, with a option to creators that don't want to appear on search)\n• Instance Join/Leave notifications\n• Component disable (disable pickups/chairs/triggers/etc)\n• Restart Button (closes and re-open the VRC automatically)\n• A option to re-scale your avatar in-game (with a height limit ofc)\n• Discord Mute (a integration to mute yourself in discord, many people play VRC and join a Voice Chat on Discord at the same time)\n• Skip Perform Stats (a option to skip the perfomance stats of avatars, since this cause some lag spikes when a avatar loads)\n• Player Pickup (grab other players by head, leash, hands, hips)\n• Third Person on Desktop\n• A build-in FSR/NIS/CAS solution (probably the most important here, this helps boosting my frames)\n↳ https://github.com/fholger/vrperfkit\n• Screenshot Manager (view, edit, delete and share your screenshots directly in-game)\n• Exit Fix (for some reason, sometimes the game takes some ages to close and we need to close using task manager)\n• Menu Clock (a little clock on menu, we need to know what time is it)\n• Mirror Resolution (scale up or down the mirror resolution)\n• Save Menu Wings (save the state of the menu wings when you close your game or menu)\n• Graphics Settings (be able to change shadow settings, lighting settings and other graphics options in-game)\n• Immobilize Button (most avatars don't have GoGo locomotion or a good locomotion, and we need a button to freeze our position)\n• Proccess Priority (option to change VRC proccess priority)\n• CPU Core Limitter\n• Pre-load Worlds\n• Automatic CC for deaf people\n↳ Also, maybe a automatic translator (this will help to communicate with other langs)\n• Manage user components (hide shader, physbone, and other components)\n• Personal Pen/Personal Keyboard/TTS for deaf/mute people\n• COLORS! Option to change the colors of menu, loading screen, nameplate, etc\n• Photosensitivity world tag (a tag that creators have to use if the world contains rapid flashing and such. If the world have this tag, a warning should appear before enter with a option to always ignore for who is not affected)\n• Remember me (sometimes we got logged out and is kinda hard to type your login when you are in a VR headset)\n• Hide Avatars by VRAM usage\n\n> And some other cool ideas: \n• Loading Screenshots (random picture from the VRC folder)\n• New components for Dynamics (such as possibility to grab specific parts and move players around: https://feedback.vrchat.com/avatar-dynamics-reports-and-feedback/p/request-possibility-to-move-players-around)\n• GIFs for VRC+ users\n• Delete/Rename inactive accounts (many accounts are holding good usernames)\n• Desktop Zoom (something like the minecraft optifine)\n• Some improvements for SlimeVR (a build-in anti-drift and such)\n• Desktop Camera\n• Age Restriction Worlds\n• Touchable buttons on VRC Camera, kinda hard to use the laser with small avatars\n• Better Safety System (automatically remove componenets that exceed the limit)\n• Allow World Creators to enable Fly/Teleport on their worlds\n• Spotify/Music Integration (Buttons to quickly pause, play, skip a song)\n• More information on friends page (last time online, friendship date, etc)\n• When accepts a request-invite in a Invite-Only instance, transfer the request to the instance owner\n• Instance Perform Condition (the instance owner choose a maximum avatar rank when create a instance, the default should be OFF/Very Poor, since the most part of users uses a Very Poor avatar)\n• Extend the Trust System or change the Trusted User condition, since is not hard to get Trusted anymore (with 3 months, some avatars uploaded and VRC+ you become trusted user)\n• Veteran Tag (not a rank, but a tag for who play the game for like 5 years like me)\n• Password Instance Type (Instances that needs a password to join)\n\nI probably forgot something, but having at least the important list will be enough\nIf I miss something, comment here and I'll update the post.",
